{"material_id": "ntce.zhongxue.jiaoyuzhishi.2023a.q27.material.recovered", "text": "材料：情境1：林强上课捣乱，受到同学责怪和老师批评，可他的行为不仅没有减少，反而频繁出现。后来，为了消除他的捣乱行为，当他捣乱时，老师和同学都不理他，久而久之，他的捣乱行为逐渐减少了。情境2：杰明上课时总是不遵守纪律，干扰同学的学习。老师找他谈话，他多次承诺予以改正，但很快又重犯。今天上课时，他趁陈军站起来回答问题时，抽掉陈军的椅子使其重重地摔了一跤。于是，老师宣布取消杰明去春游的活动资格。情境3：兴华平时课上喜欢讲闲话，老师为了改变他的这种不良习惯，不像以前那样一味地批评，而是采用新的策略，只要兴华不在课上讲闲话，老师就及时给予表扬。", "source_files": [{"path": "教资/真题/初中真题/2023年上半年教师资格证考试《教育知识与能力》（中学）题（考生回忆版）.csv", "role": "material_raw", "sha256": "a7caa1dd368126e4e8bd1a95426ef833e5bcf4e180ba77fe6c0f5ed18f5dd033", "locator": {"decoded_csv_character_start": 2474, "decoded_csv_character_end": 2745, "next_source_question_number": 31, "alignment_status": "unique_task_excerpt_with_preceding_case_section"}}, {"path": "教资/真题/初中真题/2023年上半年教师资格证考试《教育知识与能力》（中学）题（考生回忆版）.csv", "role": "question_raw", "locator": {"paper_order": 27, "alignment_status": "pending"}, "sha256": "a7caa1dd368126e4e8bd1a95426ef833e5bcf4e180ba77fe6c0f5ed18f5dd033"}], "review": {"content_verified": false, "status": "auto_parsed", "extraction_status": "source_interval_recovered_pending_expert"}, "question_ids": ["ntce.zhongxue.jiaoyuzhishi.2023a.q27"], "knowledge_node_ids": ["ntce.zhongxue.jiaoyuzhishi.m3.k02", "ntce.zhongxue.jiaoyuzhishi.m4.k02"], "ability_ids": ["ntce.zhongxue.ability.theory"], "exam_requirement_ids": ["ntce.outline.302.r009", "ntce.outline.302.r016", "ntce.outline.302.r024"], "used_by_questions": ["ntce.zhongxue.jiaoyuzhishi.2023a.q27"], "word_count": 271, "level": "zhongxue", "subject": "jiaoyuzhishi", "kind": "case_material", "source": {"origin_file": "教资/真题/初中真题/2023年上半年教师资格证考试《教育知识与能力》（中学）题（考生回忆版）.csv", "files": [{"path": "教资/真题/初中真题/2023年上半年教师资格证考试《教育知识与能力》（中学）题（考生回忆版）.csv", "role": "material_raw", "sha256": "a7caa1dd368126e4e8bd1a95426ef833e5bcf4e180ba77fe6c0f5ed18f5dd033", "locator": {"decoded_csv_character_start": 2474, "decoded_csv_character_end": 2745, "next_source_question_number": 31, "alignment_status": "unique_task_excerpt_with_preceding_case_section"}